.Sh DIAGNOSTICS
.Bl -diag
.It "[kldload-ca] error: root CA missing — run: kldload-ca init"
A command that needs the root found none.
.It "[kldload-ca] error: update-ca-trust extract failed — host trust bundle is OUT OF SYNC with the anchors dir."
The root was copied into the store's directory but the bundle programs
read was not rebuilt; they do not trust it yet.
The same message names
.Xr update-ca-certificates 8
and
.Xr trust 1
on their distributions.
.It "[kldload-ca] error: no usable system trust store — anchor dir present without its refresh tool, or an unsupported distro?"
.It "[kldload-ca] WARNING: mokutil --import failed"
Exit 1.
.It "kldload-ca: FAIL at line N: command"
Any other step that failed.
.El
